 (1,950 gold) as item 2 in the Snowball Execute build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Sky Piercer\",\"text\":\"Purchase Sky Piercer (1,500 gold) as item 3 in the Snowball Execute build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Hunter Strike\",\"text\":\"Purchase Hunter Strike (2,010 gold) as item 4 in the Snowball Execute build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 5 in the Snowball Execute build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-snowball-execute\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Rose Gold Meteor\",\"text\":\"Purchase Rose Gold Meteor (1,820 gold) as item 6 in the Snowball Execute build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-snowball-execute\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5e:[\"$\",\"script\",\"1\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$63\"}}]\n64:T8cb,{\"@context\":\"https://schema.org\",\"@type\":\"HowTo\",\"name\":\"How to Build Lancelot in Mobile Legends: Bruiser Reset\",\"description\":\"Bruiser jungle setup for games where Lancelot must enter twice around Turtle or Lord instead of relying on one clean backline execute.\",\"totalTime\":\"PT15M\",\"supply\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Queen's Wings\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToSupply\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"}],\"tool\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToTool\",\"name\":\"Retribution Battle Spell\"}],\"step\":[{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":1,\"name\":\"Buy Tough Boots\",\"text\":\"Purchase Tough Boots (700 gold) as item 1 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":2,\"name\":\"Buy War Axe\",\"text\":\"Purchase War Axe (2,100 gold) as item 2 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":3,\"name\":\"Buy Hunter Strike\",\"text\":\"Purchase Hunter Strike (2,010 gold) as item 3 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":4,\"name\":\"Buy Endless Battle\",\"text\":\"Purchase Endless Battle (2,330 gold) as item 4 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":5,\"name\":\"Buy Queen's Wings\",\"text\":\"Purchase Queen's Wings (2,250 gold) as item 5 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"},{\"@type\":\"HowToStep\",\"position\":6,\"name\":\"Buy Malefic Roar\",\"text\":\"Purchase Malefic Roar (2,060 gold) as item 6 in the Bruiser Reset build for Lancelot.\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot#build-bruiser-reset\"}],\"mainEntityOfPage\":{\"@type\":\"WebPage\",\"@id\":\"https://mlbbhub.com/heroes/lancelot\"},\"datePublished\":\"2026-04-12T00:00:00.000Z\",\"dateModified\":\"2026-05-13T00:00:00.000Z\",\"author\":{\"@type\":\"Organization\",\"name\":\"MLBBHub\",\"url\":\"https://mlbbhub.com\"}}5f:[\"$\",\"script\",\"2\",{\"type\":\"application/ld+json\",\"dangerouslySetInnerHTML\":{\"__html\":\"$64\"}}]\n60:[\"$\",\"$L65\",null,{\"hero\":{\"id\":47,\"name\":\"Lancelot\",\"slug\":\"lancelot\",\"title\":\"Blade of Roses\",\"role\":[\"Assassin\"],\"specialty\":[\"Chase\",\"Burst\"],\"lane\":[\"Jungle\"],\"tier\":\"D\",\"difficulty\":2,\"releaseYear\":2017,\"stats\":{\"durability\":40,\"offense\":50,\"controlEffect\":10,\"difficulty\":50},\"winRate\":42.93,\"pickRate\":0.58,\"banRate\":0.44,\"counters\":{\"strongAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"cecilion\",\"heroName\":\"Cecilion\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Lancelot counters long-range Mages, such as Cecilion and Pharsa, because there is a delay to their skills and Lancelot can use his 1st Skill to dodge them while going in for the kill.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"pharsa\",\"heroName\":\"Pharsa\",\"advantage\":\"strong\",\"tip\":\"Lancelot counters long-range Mages, such as Cecilion and Pharsa, because there is a delay to their skills and Lancelot can use his 1st Skill to dodge them while going in for the kill.\"}],\"weakAgainst\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"minsitthar\",\"heroName\":\"Minsitthar\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Lancelot is weak against heroes who can counter his mobility like Minsitthar and Phoveus, as his 1st Skill and Ultimate will be heavily restricted.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"phoveus\",\"heroName\":\"Phoveus\",\"advantage\":\"weak\",\"tip\":\"Lancelot is weak against heroes who can counter his mobility like Minsitthar and Phoveus, as his 1st Skill and Ultimate will be heavily restricted.\"}]},\"splashArt\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/file/mlbb/homepage/100_015bacc4e1111e5e2b4a33b5e58ff106.jpg\",\"portrait\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_dc4b821e49b904715172136017798da3.png\",\"officialMatchups\":[{\"kind\":\"best_ally\",\"heroId\":\"36\",\"heroName\":\"Aurora\",\"heroSlug\":\"aurora\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/madmin/image/737f20a2934bbae1c5fd1b129dcbe066.jpg?w=200-200-fefefe\",\"tip\":\"Mages has a high damage capacity for a short period of time. This will help Lancelot to instantly kill the enemy using his Ultimate.\"},{\"kind\":\"counters\",\"heroId\":\"18\",\"heroName\":\"Layla\",\"heroSlug\":\"layla\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_a05a03db633cc03ef3f733d2786073c4.jpg\",\"tip\":\"Marksman has a low amount of HP, during late game Lancelot can instantly kill.\"},{\"kind\":\"countered_by\",\"heroId\":\"24\",\"heroName\":\"Natalia\",\"heroSlug\":\"natalia\",\"icon\":\"https://akmwebstatic.yuanzhanapp.com/web/madmin/image_50b8723a3ca11dd18d34d26948aef12b.png\",\"tip\":\"Natalia has a skill that can silence you (unable to use skill). This will help to kill Lancelot before Lancelot can use his skills and additional to that Natalia can be Invinsible everytime she goes to bushes.\"}],\"skills\":{\"skills\":[{\"name\":\"Soul Cutter\",\"type\":\"Passive\",\"description\":\"Each time Lancelot charges, his damage is increased by 7.5% for 4s, up to 30%.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Each time Lancelot charges, his damage is increased by 7.5% for 4s, up to 30%.\"}],\"cooldown\":null,\"manaCost\":null,\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_ae0f65f46319169e0086c9249b921b16.png\",\"tags\":[\"Buff\"]},{\"name\":\"Puncture\",\"type\":\"Skill 1\",\"description\":\"Lancelot charges in the target direction, dealing 150 (+50% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies along the way and applying a Sword Mark to the first unmarked enemy hit. The Sword Mark lasts 3s.\\n\\nIf Lancelot successfully applies a Sword Mark to an enemy, the skill's cooldown will be reset.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lancelot charges in the target direction, dealing 150\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+50% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies along the way and applying a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sword Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to the first unmarked enemy hit. The \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sword Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" lasts 3s.\\n\\nIf Lancelot successfully applies a \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Sword Mark\",\"color\":\"#a6aafb\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to an enemy, the skill's cooldown will be reset.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"14s\",\"manaCost\":\"40\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_60c8287e6736521c1c00d1eda3bc07bf.png\",\"tags\":[\"Mobility\",\"AOE\"]},{\"name\":\"Thorned Rose\",\"type\":\"Skill 2\",\"description\":\"Lancelot strikes in the target direction 3 times, each time dealing 220 (+120% Extra Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit (damage is reduced when multiple enemies are hit). He's untargetable during this process. Enemies in the center of the area take all the 3 hits and are slowed by 20% for 0.5s. The slow effect can stack.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Lancelot strikes in the target direction 3 times, each time dealing 220\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+120% Extra Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit (damage is reduced when multiple enemies are hit). He's untargetable during this process. Enemies in the center of the area take all the 3 hits and are slowed by 20% for 0.5s. The slow effect can stack.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"11s\",\"manaCost\":\"60\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_146f3578adb9187559996d65a9bcab8b.png\",\"tags\":[\"AOE\",\"Slow\"]},{\"name\":\"Phantom Execution\",\"type\":\"Ultimate\",\"description\":\"After a short delay, Lancelot performs an executioner's strike in the target direction, dealing 350 (+170% Total Physical Attack) Physical Damage to enemies hit. He is invincible throughout the process.\",\"descriptionRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"After a short delay, Lancelot performs an executioner's strike in the target direction, dealing 350\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" (+170% Total Physical Attack)\",\"color\":\"#fba51f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" \"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Physical Damage\",\"color\":\"#fb1f1f\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\" to enemies hit. He is invincible throughout the process.\"}],\"cooldown\":\"36s\",\"manaCost\":\"100\",\"icon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_410d2071fe2e9cfeaed0001e1b942229.png\",\"tags\":[\"Burst\",\"Mobility\"]}],\"skillUpgradePriority\":\"3-2-1\",\"skillPriorityTip\":\"Retribution is very useful when you are Jungling/Farming. but not in Lancelot's case once you hit the first minions wave you'll add the second abilty then go hit the jungle all by yourself, and The Retribution battleground spell can be upgraded through purchasing different Jungle Items.\\nAt early game add the second ability first , so you can farm minions as fast as you can, and its very useful in dealing extra more damage at any enemy that tries to dive with his teamates at first remember to max the 2nd ability to reduce its cooldown and mana consume , then add the first ability followed by the Third ability at Lv4.\",\"skillPriorityTipRich\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Retribution is very useful when you are Jungling/Farming. but not in Lancelot's case once you hit the first minions wave you'll add the second abilty then go hit the jungle all by yourself, and The Retribution battleground spell can be upgraded through purchasing different Jungle Items. \"},{\"type\":\"lineBreak\"},{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"At early game add the second ability first , so you can farm minions as fast as you can, and its very useful in dealing extra more damage at any enemy that tries to dive with his teamates at first remember to max the 2nd ability to reduce its cooldown and mana consume , then add the first ability followed by the Third ability at Lv4.\"}]},\"synergies\":[{\"heroSlug\":\"atlas\",\"heroName\":\"Atlas\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Lancelot works well with heroes who can pull enemies together, like Atlas and Tigreal, because they allow him to hit more enemies with his AOE skills.\"},{\"heroSlug\":\"tigreal\",\"heroName\":\"Tigreal\",\"synergyScore\":8,\"reason\":\"Lancelot works well with heroes who can pull enemies together, like Atlas and Tigreal, because they allow him to hit more enemies with his AOE skills.\"}],\"combos\":[{\"type\":\"teamfight\",\"title\":\"TEAMFIGHT COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In teamfights, use Lancelot's 1st Skill on frontline enemies to springboard into their backline, then unleash his 2nd Skill on the backline for heavy damage. Follow up with his Ultimate to charge through the target and block their escape, and use his 1st Skill to continue to chase or retreat.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_60c8287e6736521c1c00d1eda3bc07bf.png\"},{\"skillId\":4720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_146f3578adb9187559996d65a9bcab8b.png\"},{\"skillId\":4730,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_410d2071fe2e9cfeaed0001e1b942229.png\"},{\"skillId\":4710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_60c8287e6736521c1c00d1eda3bc07bf.png\"}]},{\"type\":\"laning\",\"title\":\"LANING COMBOS\",\"description\":\"In the laning phase, clear Minions by repeatedly using Lancelot's 1st Skill thanks to the cooldown reset, and stack his Passive before approaching the enemy and hitting them with his 2nd Skill.\",\"skillSequence\":[{\"skillId\":4710,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_60c8287e6736521c1c00d1eda3bc07bf.png\"},{\"skillId\":4720,\"skillIcon\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_146f3578adb9187559996d65a9bcab8b.png\"}]}],\"metaDescription\":\"Lancelot build, counter, and strategy guide for Mobile Legends. I-frame timing, the S1 mark chain, core item spikes, and the matchups that actually lose games.\",\"builds\":[],\"overviewLede\":\"Lancelot does not fight. He phases through fights, dealing damage during the windows he physically cannot be touched. Time the invincibility frames correctly and he is one of the cleanest assassins in the game; time them wrong and he is a liability with a pretty dash animation.\"},\"serverLocale\":\"en\",\"curatedBuilds\":{\"source\":\"curated\",\"hero\":\"lancelot\",\"patch\":\"2.1.67\",\"lastReviewed\":\"2026-05-13\",\"stalePatch\":true,\"currentPatch\":\"2.2.16a\",\"builds\":[{\"slot\":1,\"id\":\"jungle-pickoff-default\",\"name\":\"Jungle Pickoff Default\",\"roleContext\":\"Jungle\",\"items\":[{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\",\"cost\":700,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\",\"cost\":2100,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\",\"cost\":2010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\",\"cost\":2330,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\",\"cost\":3010,\"fixed\":false},{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\",\"cost\":2120,\"fixed\":false}],\"coreItems\":[{\"slug\":\"war-axe\",\"name\":\"War Axe\"},{\"slug\":\"hunter-strike\",\"name\":\"Hunter Strike\"},{\"slug\":\"endless-battle\",\"name\":\"Endless Battle\"}],\"emblem\":{\"slug\":\"assassin\",\"name\":\"Assassin Emblem\",\"talents\":[{\"slug\":\"rupture\",\"name\":\"Rupture\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/rupture.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"seasoned-hunter\",\"name\":\"Seasoned Hunter\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/seasoned-hunter.png\",\"bucket\":\"standard\"},{\"slug\":\"killing-spree\",\"name\":\"Killing Spree\",\"iconUrl\":\"/images/talents/killing-spree.png\",\"bucket\":\"core\"}]},\"spell\":{\"slug\":\"retribution\",\"name\":\"Retribution\"},\"blessing\":{\"slug\":\"ice-retribution\",\"name\":\"Ice Retribution\"},\"flexItems\":[{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"magic-boots\",\"name\":\"Magic Boots\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"tough-boots\",\"name\":\"Tough Boots\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the enemy has low crowd control and shorter Puncture or Thorned Rose cycles matter more than tenacity.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"malefic-roar\",\"name\":\"Malefic Roar\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"blade-of-despair\",\"name\":\"Blade of Despair\"},\"trigger\":\"Use when the front line stacks Physical Defense before Lancelot can reach the marksman or mage.\"},{\"item\":{\"slug\":\"rose-gold-meteor\",\"name\":\"Rose Gold Meteor\"},\"replace\":{\"slug\":\"immortality\",\"name\":\"Immortality\"},\"trigger\":\"Use against magic burst when a shield and movement burst protect the first dive better than a delayed revive.\"}],\"notes\":\"Default jungle setup for stacking Soul Cutter through dash routes, using Ice Retribution to hold a marked target in Thorned Rose and Phantom Execution range.\",\"totalCost\":12270,\"statLines\":[{\"key\":\"physatk\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalAttack\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":335,\"sources\":[\"War Axe\",\"Hunter Strike\",\"Endless Battle\",\"Blade of Despair\"]},{\"key\":\"physpenFlat\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.physicalPenetration\",\"unit\":\"flat\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":15,\"sources\":[\"Hunter Strike\"]},{\"key\":\"spellvamp\",\"labelKey\":\"common.stats.spellVamp\",\"unit\":\"percent\",\"group\":\"offensive\",\"value\":8,\"sources\":[\"Wa