 right-0 w-3 h-3 border-b border-r border-[#C8AA6E]/30\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"absolute -top-32 -right-24 w-72 h-72 rounded-full bg-[#C8AA6E]/[0.05] blur-3xl pointer-events-none\",\"aria-hidden\":\"true\"}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative hero-article-body max-w-[860px] mx-auto\",\"children\":[[[[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-0\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"span\",null,{\"aria-hidden\":\"true\",\"className\":\"block w-10 h-[3px] bg-gradient-to-r from-[#F0D060] to-[#C8AA6E]/0 mb-3\"}],\"Is this a Lancelot draft?\"]}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-0\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Lancelot is a draft gamble. He pays off under specific conditions and bleeds rating anywhere else. Two questions decide the pick: can you hit isolated targets, and can you dodge the abilities that matter.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-1\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Pick Lancelot when the enemy leans on skill-shot CC. Tigreal flicker-ult, Atlas chains, Khufra ball, Aurora freeze, any linear stun. Thorned Rose and Phantom Execution both grant full invincibility, which means skill-shot heroes throw their biggest abilities at a target that does not exist. Pick him when the enemy backline is squishy and lacks self-peel: Pharsa, Cecilion, Layla, Change, or Lunox in light form.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-2\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"Avoid Lancelot when the enemy has point-and-click CC. Kaja's ult, Franco's hook plus suppress, Saber's ult, Phoveus' ult all bypass invincibility because they target you, not a piece of ground. You cannot I-frame a suppress. Avoid him when the enemy has heavy persistent AoE (X.Borg flame, Valir zones, Pharsa rain) because you land into the damage field the instant your I-frame ends and die mid-animation. Avoid him when your team has no frontline, because without a tank to absorb the first CC, you are the first target the enemy sees.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"p\",\"p-3\",{\"className\":\"text-[#9BA0B4] leading-relaxed mb-4 text-[15px]\",\"children\":\"If the enemy drafted two suppress heroes, do not pick Lancelot. No amount of mechanical skill outplays a targeted suppress.\"}],\"\\n\",[\"$\",\"h2\",\"h2-1\",{\"className\":\"text-xl md:text-[26px] font-heading font-bold text-[#F0D060] mt-10 mb-4 first:mt-0 text-balance uppercase tracking-[0.04em] leading-tight relative\",\"children\":[\"$L7f\",\"The one thing that makes Lancelot work\"]}],\"\\n\",\"$L80\",\"\\n\",\"$L81\",\"\\n\",\"$L82\",\"\\n\",\"$L83\",\"\\n\",\"$L84\",\"\\n\",\"$L85\",\"\\n\",\"$L86\",\"\\n\",\"$L87\",\"\\n\",\"$L88\",\"\\n\",\"$L89\",\"\\n\",\"$L8a\",\"\\n\",\"$L8b\",\"\\n\",\"$L8c\",\"\\n\",\"$L8d\"],\"$L8e\",\"$L8f\"],\"$L90\"]}]]}]]}]\n"])</script><script>self.__next_f.push([1,"a8:I[392015,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\nb8:I[131354,[\"$7\",\"$8\",\"$9\",\"$a\",\"$b\",\"$2e\",\"$3e\",\"$3f\"],\"default\"]\n6e:[\"$\",\"$L6b\",\"mathilda\",{\"href\":\"/heroes/mathilda\",\"className\":\"group block\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative bg-surface-4 border border-mlbb-gold/20 overflow-hidden card-hover hover:border-mlbb-gold/50\",\"style\":{\"boxShadow\":\"0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.3)\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"flex items-center gap-3 p-3\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"relative w-14 h-14 rounded-full overflow-hidden flex-shrink-0 bg-surface-3\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"$L6c\",null,{\"src\":\"https://akmweb.youngjoygame.com/web/svnres/img/test/homepage_2_2_16_1232_1/100_24d08ed788a9f5984bcf3b732ddcaf04.png\",\"alt\":\"Mathilda - Swift Plume\",\"unoptimized\":false,\"priority\":\"$undefined\",\"fetchPrio